title: "Khmer News Classification Using Traditional Machine Learning Algorithms"
abstract: "A reproducible experimental workflow for Khmer-language news classification comparing four traditional machine learning algorithms (Multinomial Naive Bayes, Logistic Regression, Linear SVM, Random Forest) under Bag of Words and TF-IDF representations (word- and character-level) on the KhNeAC dataset with six segmentation configurations."
